# Every version is pinned (secure-coding guideline A.3) and was verified on
# Python 3.12 with the full generate -> SME -> MCQ -> evidence -> manager
# workflow. requirements.txt is the full lock generated from this file:
#
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.12 -o requirements.txt
#
# Python 3.12 required (numpy 2.5 needs >= 3.12); tested on 3.12.

